# No environment variables are needed. The "Send Us a Message" form on /contact
# posts straight to FormSubmit (https://formsubmit.co/ajax-documentation) from the
# browser, which delivers the message to the owner's test inbox
# (jasonofem79@gmail.com). Recipient addresses live in app/contact/page.tsx
# (the foundation inbox is intentionally not a recipient yet) — there is no
# API key and no backend route to configure.
#
# Any leftover form-email environment variables in the Vercel project belong to
# removed setups and are unused — delete them. If any key was ever pasted into a
# chat or otherwise shared, treat it as exposed: delete it and revoke/regenerate
# it at the provider (or remove the provider entirely).
